Package: gevrek
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Aydemir Şahin <ulaas@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @LIBRARIES@, polkitd | policykit-1, libgl1-mesa-dri
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xwayland, pipewire-bin, foot
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://ulaas.github.io/gevrek/
Description: A tiling window manager and desktop for Wayland
 gevrek is a tiling Wayland compositor with its own desktop around it: a
 panel, a launcher, notifications, a lock screen, and a settings program
 (gevrek-studio) in which every setting has a form.
 .
 After installing, gevrek is in the login manager's list of sessions.
